                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Right, From That Time On, The Switch is Turned On Already",
                        "jpn": "そう、あの時はもう、スイッチが入ってたんじゃないかなあ"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "2": {
                    "ID": "424067",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/424067",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Do You Believe In Encounters Scheduled Long Before?",
                        "jpn": "ずっと前から仕組まれてた、そんな出会いって、信じる?"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "3": {
                    "ID": "424068",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/424068",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Hand to Hand, Shoulder to Shoulder, Back to Back, And Then. It is Fine Even With Clothing.",
                        "jpn": "手と手、肩と肩、背中と背中、それから。 服の上からだっていいんだ"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "4": {
                    "ID": "431040",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/431040",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "There Are Times When We Feel Like We Understand Each Other Beyond Our Imaginations. The Opposite Happens Frequently, Too",
                        "jpn": "想像を超えてわかり合えてるって、感じる時がある。 逆の時も多いけどね"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "5": {
                    "ID": "431041",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/431041",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Obstacles Aren`t Always the Ones Close To Us. The Less We Know the Person, the Tougher It Is",
                        "jpn": "邪魔をするのが、近しい人間だけとは限らない。 知らない人ほど、手厳しい"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "6": {
                    "ID": "436820",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/436820",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "A Good Way of Forgetting All Your Worries: How About Sticking Your Head Into Other People's Business? What Do You Think?",
                        "jpn": "悩みを忘れるいい方法。 他人のトラブルに首を突っ込んでみるってのは、どう?"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "7": {
                    "ID": "436847",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/436847",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "An Image Must Be Continually Built Upon For Something That Crumbles at the Edges Already",
                        "jpn": "イメージはどんどん構築しなきゃ。 ただでさえ、端から崩れてくものなんだから"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "8": {
                    "ID": "439589",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/439589",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "The less time we have the more we accomplish, the more we end up doing. Love is the same.",
                        "jpn": "時間がないときほど、多くのことができる。やってしまう。 もちろん、恋だって"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "9": {
                    "ID": "439590",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/439590",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "There's no need for clever scenarios in memories. The second they come out everyone speaks nonsense of them",
                        "jpn": "思い出に気の利いたシナリオは要らない。 口から出た瞬間、どうせみんなたわ言"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "10": {
                    "ID": "439591",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/439591",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "The reason a one-person fight feels hollow... isn't just because it's one person. The eyes of the audience hurt.",
                        "jpn": "一人相撲が虚しいのは、一人だからってだけじゃない。 観客の目が、痛いんだ"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "11": {
                    "ID": "439592",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/439592",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Time does not solve the thorns in our heart. It just puts a label of oblivion on it.",
                        "jpn": "胸につかえていることを、時は解決してくれない。 忘却のラベルを貼るだけで"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "12": {
                    "ID": "446065",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/446065",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "To bind. To deceive. To take away. To give. What's most painful is to wait.",
                        "jpn": "縛ること。欺くこと。奪うこと。与えること。 どれより辛いのが、待つこと"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "13": {
                    "ID": "489361",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/489361",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "The vase was leaning toward one side, yet you didn't notice? Because there was not even a drop of water left.",
                        "jpn": "器が傾いてるのに、気づかなかった? 水はもう一滴も残ってなかったからね"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "14": {
                    "ID": "1162311",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/1162311",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "There was never an instance where the tuning matched. I have come to think that there exists a better spot out there.",
                        "jpn": "チューニングが合ったためしがない。 もっと良好な場所があると思ってしまう"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "15": {
                    "ID": "1162321",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/1162321",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "The things hidden from view are destroying everything around it. Since it was never there, nothing can be done to deal with it.",
                        "jpn": "見つからないものが、まわりを壊す。 そこにないから、手の打ちようがない"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "16": {
                    "ID": "1162631",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/1162631",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "I do writhe in embarrassment when I reminisce my childhood. Moreover so if I make comparisons.",
                        "jpn": "小さい頃を想って、恥ずかしさに身悶えすることがある。 それに比べれば"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "17": {
                    "ID": "1162641",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/1162641",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "I have lies that I want to expose. I have truths that I do not wish to believe. I have one of these each.",
                        "jpn": "バレてほしい嘘がある。信じてほしくないホントウがある。 一つずつ、ある"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "18": {
                    "ID": "1162651",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/1162651",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Aren't you taking too much for granted? Complaining that you are claustrophobic while you are hiding in your own shell.",
                        "jpn": "虫が良すぎるんじゃない? 殻に閉じこもってるくせに、閉所恐怖症なんて"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "19": {
                    "ID": "1162661",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/1162661",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "I move on as I am losing interest. Most of the time though, I seem to have already lost interest before I move on.",
                        "jpn": "飽きるから次に進めるという。 大抵は、進む前にもう飽きてるみたいだけど"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "20": {
                    "ID": "1162671",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/1162671",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Love is beyond reason. Lovers who say this to one another are poets, critics, philosophers.",
                        "jpn": "恋愛は理屈じゃない。 そう語り合う恋人達は、詩人、評論家、哲学者"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "21": {
                    "ID": "1162681",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/1162681",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "I think I want to return to the crossroad. Would have been better if I had chosen the right one. That journey filled only with regret.",
                        "jpn": "別れ道まで戻りたいと思う。右にすれば良かったって。 後悔だけのそんな道程"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "22": {
                    "ID": "1162691",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/1162691",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Having troubles expressing yourself? Try to strike a conversation with your eyes and you'll soon find yourself in the mood for a chat.",
                        "jpn": "口べたで悩んでる? 目で会話してみるといい、すぐにしゃべりたくなるから"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "23": {
                    "ID": "1162701",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/1162701",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "I have come to desire catching a cold in anticipation of the nursing and the home-cooked dishes. I didn't include the later part suffering in my imagination at all.",
                        "jpn": "看病や手料理を期待して、風邪をひきたくなる。 後の苦しみは想像もしない"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "24": {
                    "ID": "1162711",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/1162711",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Nightfall did not bring about anything at all. It was the fault of the sun that the colors faded.",
                        "jpn": "夜は何もしてくれないよ。 色あせるのは太陽のせいだし"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "25": {
                    "ID": "1162721",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/1162721",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "It's the fault of others. I'm not at fault. All the fault lies in others. Only I myself am―",
                        "jpn": "他人が悪い。自分は悪くない。他人だけが悪い。 自分だけが―"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "26": {
                    "ID": "1162731",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "CATEGORY": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/white-album/episodes/1162731",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "We were sitting together all night long, not even being able to move a single inch.",
                        "jpn": "僕達は一緒に座っている、一晩中、動くこともなく"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                }
            }
        }
    }
}